 collapse. Escape or reset?\"** As the first bot lunged, Ethan made a choice. He grabbed the nearest object—a crumbling street sign—and swung it like a weapon, screaming into the void, **\"I’M NOT PLAYING YOUR GAME ANYMORE.\"** The screen stuttered. Then, for the first time, something stuttered back.", "logprobs": [{"token": "E", "logprob": -1.9033106565475464}, {"token": "than", "logprob": -0.011208427138626575}, {"token": " j", "logprob": -0.38688793778419495}, {"token": "olt", "logprob": -0.0007765853079035878}, {"token": "ed", "logprob": -1.5258672647178173e-05}, {"token": " awake", "logprob": -0.011262179352343082}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.20790234208106995}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.06994901597499847}, {"token": " bl", "logprob": -1.4769610166549683}, {"token": "inding", "logprob": -0.2559168338775635}, {"token": " white", "logprob": -1.5739284753799438}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -1.4059031009674072}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.8672048449516296}, {"token": " loading", "logprob": -0.0793217271566391}, {"token": " screen", "logprob": -0.0009617946925573051}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.11539345234632492}, {"token": " his", "logprob": -0.2984730303287506}, {"token": " fingers", "logprob": -1.0381869077682495}, {"token": " twitch", "logprob": -1.6002329587936401}, {"token": "ing", "logprob": -0.00014280252798926085}, {"token": " as", "logprob": -1.2223256826400757}, {"token": " he", "logprob": -0.9577181935310364}, {"token": " heard", "logprob": -3.765298843383789}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.08636090159416199}, {"token": " familiar", "logprob": -0.7895787358283997}, {"token": " ch", "logprob": -1.9023590087890625}, {"token": "ime", "logprob": -0.011668526567518711}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.005093337036669254}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.06107577681541443}, {"token": " system", "logprob": -1.40677011013031}, {"token": " boot", "logprob": -0.5040596723556519}, {"token": "ing", "logprob": -0.3055265247821808}, {"token": " up", "lo